// Video upload to adaptive HLS playback (sequence-diagram)
// Grounded in backend/controllers/videoUpload.controller.ts and
// video-transcoder/src/{index,services/transcode.service}.ts

title Video Upload - Presign to HLS Playback

autoNumber on

Instructor [icon: user-check]
Frontend [icon: nextjs]
Backend [icon: nodejs]
S3 [icon: aws-simple-storage-service]
Kafka [icon: kafka]
Transcoder [icon: nodejs]
Postgres [icon: postgresql]

Instructor > Frontend: pick file for a course
Frontend > Backend: POST /video-upload/presign
Backend > Backend: assert instructor owns course
Backend > S3: presign PUT {videoId}/original.mp4
Backend --> Frontend: uploadUrl + videoId
Frontend > S3: PUT file direct, browser to bucket
Frontend > Backend: POST /video-upload confirm
Backend > Postgres: Video row status UPLOADED
Backend > Kafka: publish video.uploaded
Kafka > Transcoder: consume video.uploaded
Transcoder > Backend: callback status TRANSCODING
Transcoder > S3: GET original.mp4
Transcoder > Transcoder: ffmpeg ladder 240p 480p 720p 1080p
Transcoder > Transcoder: write master.m3u8 + variant playlists
Transcoder > S3: upload {videoId}/ segments + playlists
Transcoder > Backend: callback READY + hlsMasterPath
Backend > Postgres: Video status READY
Frontend > Backend: GET /video-upload/{videoId}
Backend --> Frontend: metadata + hlsMasterPath
Frontend > Transcoder: GET /api/video-transcoder/hls/{videoId}/master.m3u8
Transcoder > S3: stream object with Range support
Transcoder --> Frontend: playlist then .ts segments
Frontend > Instructor: hls.js adaptive playback
